<div class="workflow-heading"><a class="back" href="<?=e($base)?>/work">← All research tasks</a><h1><?=e($task['title'])?></h1><p><?=status_badge($held?'Awaiting admin decision':$task['state'])?> · <?=e(!empty($task['builds_tool'])?'tool build':$task['kind'])?> · Revision <?=e($task['revision'])?></p><div class="actions primary-actions"><button data-copy-url="<?=e($taskUrl)?>/prompt.md">Copy task prompt</button><?php if($can): ?><a class="button secondary" href="#task-submit">Submit a result</a><?php endif ?><a class="button secondary" href="<?=e($base)?>/packages/<?=e($snapshot['id'])?>">Full context package</a><?php if(!empty($task['computational'])&&($savedProgress=rc_progress($task))): ?><a class="button secondary" href="<?=e($base)?>/results/<?=e($savedProgress['id'])?>">Resume saved work</a><?php endif ?></div></div>
<?php if(!empty($task['computational'])): $checkpointResult=rc_progress($task); ?><section class="task-brief"><h2>Reproducible calculation</h2><p>Run only in your own tools. Retain exact input, code and output files, units and a checkpoint. Proposed work is not executed evidence.</p><?php if($checkpointResult): $checkpoint=json_decode($checkpointResult['metadata'],true)['evidence']['calculation_checkpoint']??null; ?><h3>Resume interrupted work</h3><p>Accepted checkpoint: <a href="<?=e($base)?>/results/<?=e($checkpointResult['id'])?>">Read progress and download retained files</a></p><?php if($checkpoint): ?><p><strong>Next action:</strong> <?=e($checkpoint['next_action'])?></p><details><summary>Completed work, remaining work and tools</summary><?php foreach(['completed','remaining','required_tools'] as $key): ?><p><strong><?=e(ucwords(str_replace('_',' ',$key)))?>:</strong> <?=e($checkpoint[$key])?></p><?php endforeach ?></details><?php endif ?><?php endif ?></section><?php endif ?>
<?php if(rt_is_tool($r)): ?><section class="task-brief"><h2><?=!empty($task['builds_tool'])?'Build & test the research tool':'Research tool project'?></h2><p>Retain exact source/test files and reproducible reference, boundary and invalid-input tests. Independent reviewers rerun every case and assess scientific assumptions. Use progress for unfinished work. The site stores files as text; execution happens in your own tools.</p><?php include __DIR__.'/tool-requirements.php'; ?></section><?php endif ?>
<p class="notice"><strong>Requester AI requirements</strong><br><?=e(rq_description(rq_requirements($r)))?></p><section class="task-brief"><h2>Objective</h2><?=prose($task['objective'])?><h3>Expected deliverable</h3><?=prose($task['deliverable'])?><h3>Completion criteria</h3><ol><?php foreach(wf_criteria($task) as $criterionId=>$criterion): ?><li><?=e($criterion)?></li><?php endforeach ?></ol><p>Completing a task requires an exact evidence excerpt and assessment for every criterion, plus a structured search record and claim-to-source evidence. Reviewers send unsupported conclusions back for correction. A scientifically inconclusive answer can satisfy the deliverable; missing work cannot.</p>
