<?php if($can||$error): ?><section class="form-panel" id="task-submit"><h2>Return the unchanged AI packet</h2><p>The AI can include charts, diagrams, animations and interactive pages in its structured evidence packet, with backing data and source links. Paste the complete JSON exactly as your AI returned it. Do not edit the research, identifiers or evidence checks. If it fails validation, copy the repair prompt back to the same AI conversation and paste its entire new output.</p>
<form method="post" data-workflow-form><?=csrf()?><?php field('AI result JSON — paste unchanged','payload',$input,'textarea',true); ?>
<fieldset><legend>Prompt edits and other human input</legend><p class="fine">A platform repair prompt can fix formatting or validation. Disclose edits made BEFORE the first AI message too: changing the initial prompt, deleting instructions or context, adding sources, requesting a preferred conclusion, changed scope, edited output or later steering. Both disclosures are public and self-reported; we cannot inspect your external AI conversation.</p><label>Did you change the prompt or add input?<select name="human_level" required><option value="">Choose a disclosure</option><?php foreach(['none'=>'None — initial handoff and output unchanged; no extra input','repair_only'=>'Only platform repair; initial handoff and output unchanged','influenced'=>'I edited the initial prompt, added guidance, or edited output','unsure'=>'I am unsure whether I influenced it'] as $value=>$label): ?><option value="<?=e($value)?>" <?=($_POST['human_level']??'')===$value?'selected':''?>><?=e($label)?></option><?php endforeach ?></select></label><label>Describe prompt edits or additional input (required for influence or uncertainty)<textarea name="human_details" rows="3" maxlength="3000"><?=e($_POST['human_details']??'')?></textarea></label><p class="fine">Substantive input or uncertainty quarantines the packet. Research cannot advance until an admin approves it. Rejection excludes it from research and allows a fresh submission.</p></fieldset>
<div class="actions"><button name="operation" value="check" formnovalidate>Check packet</button></div>
<div data-workflow-error role="status" aria-live="polite"><?php if($error): ?><p class="warning" role="alert"><strong>Not accepted — nothing advanced.</strong> <?=e($error)?></p><?php elseif($checked): ?><p>Packet checks passed. Nothing has been submitted. Confirm the terms and submit the unchanged packet.</p><?php endif ?></div>
<div data-repair-panel <?=$repair?'':'hidden'?>><p>Do not repair the JSON yourself. Send this prompt to the same AI conversation, then paste its complete new output above. If only your disclosure is missing, complete the separate fields above.</p><button type="button" class="secondary" data-copy-repair>Copy AI repair prompt</button><details><summary>Read the repair prompt</summary><textarea data-repair-text readonly rows="8"><?=e($repair)?></textarea></details><p data-repair-status role="status"></p></div>
